config BR2_PACKAGE_Q2LIBD
	bool "q2libd"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SQLITE
	select BR2_PACKAGE_Q2PLAYER_FFMPEG
	select BR2_PACKAGE_Q2_MBEDTLS
	help
	  Vamp OS's library service (libd/, docs/libd.md), its first slice: the card's songs and the
	  signed-in apps' server catalogues, in the databases q2ui and q2playd read.
